    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-01",
      "title": "一、新年",
      "source_number": "一",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 30,
      "end_paragraph": 214,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 162,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 8612,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "5fbfe21b27c5f65ad76a206446dfbb9e758f85db4226d08c96439636df325905",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "3e285d5ef8eb889041b28ca12b94f0147213d244f7d81922337b33f2e76f53da"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 8608,
      "opening_anchor": "一、新年",
      "closing_anchor": "这个时候，外面传来几声闷响。隔着小窗，他们看见了五颜六色的光——那是庆祝新年的人们开始燃放烟火。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-02",
      "title": "二、异梦",
      "source_number": "二",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 215,
      "end_paragraph": 295,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 66,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 4670,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "0c160e9f8fb55e0af17abd48fb9f7dd4a93f479b4203c7b7d7928fd13a093bfc",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "805687723fec27993ebca6f260714613033ba9a0d179495419bf23ff19f4e867"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 4666,
      "opening_anchor": "二、异梦",
      "closing_anchor": "陆一鸣这么一想，心里竟也变得坦然。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-03",
      "title": "三、指环",
      "source_number": "三",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 296,
      "end_paragraph": 411,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 101,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 5157,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "04da6685ee4b5ac07b74d0cb51f275d00711d660755b9235d6483d56ce5e8356",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "5bb9ef5e5e2c70130c6055e28309eab2862fd7f7594cadc7aea03d9e23b393ed"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 5153,
      "opening_anchor": "三、指环",
      "closing_anchor": "突然，一个机仆不知从哪儿钻了出来，嘎吱嘎吱地跑到他跟前，问：“先生，需要帮忙吗？”"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-04",
      "title": "四、往事",
      "source_number": "四",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 412,
      "end_paragraph": 558,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 113,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 7899,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "069bbd0c78f598fad368a4c7d39885f383b46813c3bfccaa049aae226decc40d",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "c3c9892bcf991f25365f34d3aebe71009a1201180c10b0b7ca277623a90c54de"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 7895,
      "opening_anchor": "四、往事",
      "closing_anchor": "了地。他不断对陆一鸣说自己没看走眼。在陆一鸣启程前，陈向南还特意调拨了十好几箱上好的法兰西干邑，配到先遣队的必需物资里。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-05",
      "title": "五、访客",
      "source_number": "五",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 559,
      "end_paragraph": 658,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 84,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 6139,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "350d373cfdc61abb7982db7411d57433798de963580f8180c97bbd1a132c4cab",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "c1c68e7c0359457fd393520aa4eb1267c3d54bac5d00514541a4f79073d2d304"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 6135,
      "opening_anchor": "五、访客",
      "closing_anchor": "“别——”陆一鸣急忙摆手，“算了！还是别了。”"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-06",
      "title": "六、梦婆",
      "source_number": "六",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 659,
      "end_paragraph": 744,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 74,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 5489,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "6e0ee06db5b1b7d363016b546c9cbcd48968ba6117c91cad8a401d6cfb585cf8",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "129b9a6c8dadbe5aabcb2d82527ab01bcb4178a2a0cb30dea5232aecfdb58b42"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 5485,
      "opening_anchor": "六、梦婆",
      "closing_anchor": "“伊丝，你在乱说什么啊！”陈柳的脸又红了，她嗔怒地跺了跺脚，责怪起这个胡乱说话的老太婆来。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-07",
      "title": "七、谜团",
      "source_number": "七",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 745,
      "end_paragraph": 854,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 97,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 7030,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "0b8e50b8351ac5303293ae9a8ff0a52161e394e61bab844267c5c7d11bbc014f",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "53fcc148c7ee76c6c0062acb70251b4d3f9e2278d92fb40b20882a0c1bcc1e93"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 7026,
      "opening_anchor": "七、谜团",
      "closing_anchor": "“帮！当然帮！”齐孝军哪还顾得上细究陆一鸣那团乱麻般的行事逻辑，俯身凑过去，拍了拍对方的肩膀，算是应了下来。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-08",
      "title": "八、真相",
      "source_number": "八",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 855,
      "end_paragraph": 998,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 114,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 6204,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "ff303ccb7932638361d7c23f4f962f1e2cfeeaa0b0cf981edfcdedb910565f43",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "cca20c73da6a8dcd21704a01734fc6dfc304b690926ec4e5a53633db045c6569"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 6200,
      "opening_anchor": "八、真相",
      "closing_anchor": "他不敢细想下去，抓起床头的瓶子灌了几口酒，一头倒在床上，昏昏沉沉地睡了过去。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-09",
      "title": "九、追忆",
      "source_number": "九",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 999,
      "end_paragraph": 1088,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 59,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 4365,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "3aa5d4ec62bfc35e8cd1db8c59fb89df508effbf10fc6baab38d903920d1d958",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "5c56e87cab6a6ce84e4e21aa47ed46267958d789e5fb0b0459e343b4f384f570"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 4361,
      "opening_anchor": "九、追忆",
      "closing_anchor": "步履轻盈地朝他走来时，为什么他心里充溢的全是亲切和熟稔；当她拉着他的手疾步如飞时，他又为什么会有一种似曾经历的奇异感觉。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-10",
      "title": "十、故乡",
      "source_number": "十",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 1089,
      "end_paragraph": 1156,
      "statistics": {
        "nonempty_paragraphs": 55,
        "characters_excluding_whitespace": 4849,
        "text_sha256_excluding_whitespace": "65a36c8d077f32b65e4d8e5ed9eedd2a9400ee5362e43269e4233d76f407d8c0",
        "paragraph_sequence_sha256": "540af61b1aeef671f31835e73af11c04fd233ed5bedcd2c5b88368465a9117e6"
      },
      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 4845,
      "opening_anchor": "十、故乡",
      "closing_anchor": "。他轻轻把它拿起来，凑到鼻子下面，竟仍能嗅到一丝淡淡的腥味——似乎在提醒他：先前那一番刻意的遗忘，究竟有多荒谬、多徒劳。"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-11",
      "title": "十一、重逢",
      "source_number": "十一",
      "role": "chapter",
      "section_kind": "numbered_chapter",
      "start_paragraph": 1157,
      "end_paragraph": 1260,
      "statistics": {
