      "characters_excluding_heading_and_whitespace": 4714,
      "opening_anchor": "十八、基地",
      "closing_anchor": "在博士渐行渐远之际，一个似有似无的声音飘了过来：“对了，我仍旧做梦。”"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "body-unit-19",
